### Secret To Happiness

Just when you thought it was over.... nope, no way.. it's on again for a second time this year but this time, it's all NEW! We have new international artists, a new venue with new cabin accommodation, a new location on Bribie Island, a new format with workshops starting on the Saturday and running right through until Monday 5pm. We've got too much dancing, too much drumming, yoga, singing, catered food, a performance with a feast. It's going to be the best way to kick off the silly season that we can possibly think of. Celebrate life, xmas and all things that make you happy this December 1-3. Everyone is welcome and there is something for everyone. We encourage absolute beginners to experienced drummers and dancers to come along. Whatever level you are at, you are going to have a blast. Bring friends, make friends, eat, move and play for three days. And we are extending Early Bird Tickets until October 7th.. so be in quick! Top three reasons to come to Camp Afro Foli

-   International artists that you don't have to travel to the other side of the world to see!
-   You get super fit and feel super awesome
-   If your an advanced drummer or dancer, intense training over three full days
-   If your a beginner, you are about to discover the secret to happiness!

DRUMMERS AND DANCERS ARE HAPPY PEOPLE! See you all very soon for some serious fun!
